 Help                                                                 Esc Close
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Everywhere                                                                  
   Ctrl-P         Command palette                                              
   :              Command line (q, q!, w, wq)                                  
   Space          Actions menu (which-key)                                     
   /              Filter requests                                              
   Tab            Next pane                                                    
   Shift-Tab      Previous pane                                                
   1 2 3          Jump to Collections, Request, Response                       
   Ctrl-h j k l   Move to the neighbouring pane                                
   Ctrl-o Ctrl-i  Back and forward through opened requests                     
   Ctrl-B         Show or hide collections                                     
   g              Go to a section (gu gp ga gh gb gs gt gS gm gr)              
   [ ]            Previous and next section tab                                
   ?              Help                                                         
   q              Quit                                                         
   Ctrl-C         Quit (twice), or Esc while typing                            
   1-16 of 60 lines, scroll for more                                           
